UPSTREAM PROVENANCE RECORD
==========================

This file is the living inventory mandated by ADR 0018 ("Adopt OpenCode's
Presentation Layer as a Pinned Reduced Vendor Behind Two Crucible-Owned
Ports"). It records, for every vendored or vendored-and-modified path, the
upstream source it was copied from, the local modifications applied, and the
date of the copy. It is created by the first extraction commit and updated by
every extraction commit after it, because extraction is ongoing rather than
one-shot.

The companion licence file is THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md at the repository root.


